  "prefLabel": "Nuh 102.01 Administrator-In-Training (AIT)",
  "priorExpiration": "1998-12-08",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nuh 102.01 \"Administrator-In-Training (AIT)\" means an individual who is in an internship, not to exceed 12 months, for the purpose of being exposed to all areas of nursing home administration as outlined in the AIT internship evaluation checklist.\n\nSource. #5326, eff 2-13-92; ss by #5524, eff 12-8-92, EXPIRED: 12-8-98\n\nNew. #7592, eff 11-16-01",
